nt information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Expressing Surprise", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Here are some expressions of surprise.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Really?  <br>Wow! <br> Wow, that's amazing! <br> Go on!  <br>You don't say! <br> Is that right? No kidding! <br> No!  <br>Unbelievable!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Oh boy, my family is out there in the audience!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Wow, mine too!", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Present Simple Tense vs. The Present Continuous Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Simple tense to talk about routines -- things that don't change.  <br>    You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about actions that are happening now.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Everyone is dressed up! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": " I'm glad I'm wearing my good clothes then.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to dress up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to put on formal clothing ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Everyone at the graduation ceremony is dressed up!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear at a graduation ceremony.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to take off ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to remove ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She's taking off her coat. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pale ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " light in color  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She has on a pale blue coat.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "striped", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a pattern of lines ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My dad is wearing a grey striped jacket.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cap and gown ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a mortar board cap and academic style coat worn at graduation ceremonies ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Everyone put on their caps and gowns before the ceremony.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "chancellor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a legal official  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The university chancellor spoke at the graduation.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "dean ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person responsible for a department at a university", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: The dean asked to see me about a scholarship.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a 50-75 word dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You are pointing out your family to a friend at a graduation ceremony.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Point out someone standing near them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say what they look like.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say what they are wearing.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about my family at a graduation ceremony.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I say what they look like.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I say what they are wearing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I listen to my partner talk about their family.", "type": "text"}]}]}